{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29085","headline":"晚登龙门驿楼 · 许浑","name":"晚登龙门驿楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼龙多处凿门开，万古人知夏禹材。\n青嶂远分从地断，洪流高泻自天来。\n风云有路皆烧尾，波浪无程尽曝腮。\n心感膺门身过此，晚山秋树独徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}